  m_text: 'Welcome to Stuck Snacks!


    In this game, it''s snack time, but as
    always, the vending machine is unreliable. Your snacks might get stuck


    You
    buy snacks by entering the corresponding code and clicking enter


    You can
    get the snacks unstuck by dropping another snack on top'
